RideBili runs two separate, statically linked audio conversion executables.
Both use FFmpeg n7.1.2 (LGPL-2.1-or-later configuration).
The MP3 helper also uses LAME 3.100 (LGPL-2.0-or-later).
See tools/build_audio.sh and tools/build_pcm.sh.
FFmpeg: https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/tree/n7.1.2
LAME: https://lame.sourceforge.io/
The accompanying RideBili source archive contains the corresponding
source archives, their original license notices and the build scripts.
